{
 "about": "Front ZT0: the zh-Hant glossary (plan analysis/front-plans/front-i18n-zh.md §5 and §1.2 #8) that src/i18n/zh-hant/zh-hant.test.ts enforces through the SC4 lint framework (profile zh-Hant) on every Traditional Chinese string. Adapted from the reviewed zh-Hans glossary (kept beside each row as reference) to Taiwan's standard (user decision of 2026-11-19: Ministry of Education character forms, National Academy for Educational Research terms, Taiwan software vocabulary), with the English patterns unchanged. A term applies when its English pattern matches the English source: the Chinese must then match the zh-Hant pattern (no word boundaries in Chinese). Names are fixed interface names (an exact name applies only to a whole string). Forbidden are 您, the zh-Hans list's rejected forms in Traditional characters, and the mainland vocabulary that the script-purity check cannot see because it is written in Traditional characters (軟件, 信息, 默認, 屏幕, 鼠標, 網絡, 視頻, 打印, 菜單, 窗口, 加載, 導出, 導入, 用戶, 搜索, 字符, 鏈接, 射電, 多普勒, 哈勃, 信噪比, 數據, 保存, 點擊, 光標, 刷新, 另存為). Words that are mainland usage in one sense but legitimate Taiwan usage in another (程序 procedure, 設置 to set up, 支持 to support, 質量 mass, 圖像, 文件 document, 打開, 退出, 幫助, 查看, 重置, 恢復, 查找, 列表) are not forbidden: the term and name rows prefer the Taiwan form (程式, 設定, 支援, 品質, 影像, 檔案, 開啟, 結束, 說明, 檢視, 重設, 還原, 尋找, 清單), and the reviewer reads for them. VIREO's own names follow the decided forms: Save 儲存, Save As 另存新檔, Record 記錄, Find 尋找, Search 搜尋, Show 顯示, Display 顯示, View 檢視, Slew 轉動, Init/Go 初始化/開始, Scan 瀏覽, Clear 清除, Reset 重設, Open 開啟, Restore 還原, Print 列印, Exit 結束, Help 說明, Hot List 目標清單, investigation 探究, tour 導覽, lab 實驗, Instructor mode 講師模式, Demonstration Mode 示範模式, Observer's Notebook 觀測者筆記本. Translations are web adaptations by OpenVireo, never CLEA's.",
